  "funfacts": [
    "We picked every part ourselves, saved up for 8 years, then built the",
    "whole thing by hand, piece by piece. The assembly took an afternoon.",
    "The waiting took most of my teens.",
    "",
    "Scratch is where I met programming. In middle school I started a",
    "coding club, and we shipped Asteroids in it — drag-and-drop blocks,",
    "collision maths worked out by hand, and a room full of people who",
    "had never written a line.",
    "",
    "Spider-Man is my guy. The Spider-Verse films are my favourite films,",
    "full stop — nothing else animates like that. And yes, I own more",
    "Spider-Man Lego sets than a third-year student should admit to.",
    "",
    "My manga shelves hold around 300 volumes — among them exclusives,",
    "collector printings and limited editions. The gallery above only shows",
    "what I rate highly. It doesn't show the wall behind me."
